<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Macro for farming Endurance in Jujutsu Chronicles Roblox game</Major>
    <Description>Macro for farming Endurance in Jujutsu Chronicles Roblox game, just activate the macro, it will work indefinidely until you deactivate it. The macro automatically forces the character to press T to level up Endurance. Suitable for stronger players due to more stamina</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 23 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 23 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 5 9999999</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox Jujutsu Chronicles</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>